+- This turn now runs at max. Claude Code clears it at his next message (measured 2026-10-04), so while the work is design, plan or architecture, invoke this skill FIRST in every turn. `.codex/hooks/dxb-design-max.py` reminds you on each of his messages until the mode is closed.
+- His yes to the plan closes it, as the first step of that turn, with no `cd` before it: `python3 "/home/dxb/DxB Global OS/.codex/hooks/dxb-design-max.py" close`. Building, fixing and testing run at the session's level.
